      <h1 class="zt-in zt-in-1 zt-hero-h1">Unified Platform for Sourcing &amp; Tender Management</h1>
      <p class="zt-in zt-in-2 zt-hero-p">The sourcing portal of Zaytouna, an olive oil manufacturer. From fresh olives and glass bottles to pressing equipment, every request, tender, bid and decision lives in one place.</p>
