  <!-- Supplier CTA -->
  <section id="suppliers" style="max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 120px 32px">
    <div class="zt-sup">
      <div class="zt-sup-body">
        <span style="font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #DCEB4B">For suppliers</span>
        <h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(36px, 4.4vw, 58px); line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -0.015em; color: #FBF3DF">Grow with us.</h2>
        <p style="margin: 0; max-width: 480px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; color: #C9D3BC">Supply an olive oil producer that buys all year round. Compete on a level field, with clear rules, clear deadlines and a clear answer every time.</p>
        <ul class="zt-bens">
            <li class="zt-ben"><span class="zt-ben-ico"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3v18M5 21h14M4 7h16"/><path d="M4 7 2 13h4L4 7ZM20 7l-2 6h4l-2-6Z"/></svg></span><span><b>Fair, transparent scoring</b><span>Weights are set before bidding opens, and every bid is scored the same way.</span></span></li>
            <li class="zt-ben"><span class="zt-ben-ico"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7h18M6 12h12M10 17h4"/></svg></span><span><b>Tenders that fit you</b><span>Get invited to tenders in the categories you actually supply.</span></span></li>
            <li class="zt-ben"><span class="zt-ben-ico"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 3H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8l-5-5Z"/><path d="M14 3v5h5M9 14l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><span><b>Register once</b><span>Upload your legal documents, tax number and licenses one time.</span></span></li>
            <li class="zt-ben"><span class="zt-ben-ico"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 8a6 6 0 1 0-12 0c0 7-3 9-3 9h18s-3-2-3-9"/><path d="M13.7 21a2 2 0 0 1-3.4 0"/></svg></span><span><b>Always in the loop</b><span>Clear deadlines, clarification requests and the final result, all notified.</span></span></li>
        </ul>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; margin-top: 8px">
          <a class="zt-btn" href="/Suppliers/Register" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; min-height: 54px; padding: 0 28px; border-radius: 999px; background: #DCEB4B; color: #17402A; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 17px">Register as a supplier
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
          <a class="zt-btn" href="/Auth/Login" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 54px; padding: 0 24px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid rgba(251,243,223,.45); color: #FBF3DF; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px">I already have an account</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="zt-sup-media">
        <img src="/landing/images/warehouse.jpg" alt="A sunlit warehouse with crates of olive oil bottles and stacked boxes" loading="lazy">
        <div class="zt-join zt-reveal">
          <span class="zt-join-title">Join in three steps</span>
          <ol>
            <li><span>1</span><div><b>Register your company</b><small>Details, documents and categories</small></div></li>
            <li><span>2</span><div><b>Get approved</b><small>Our team reviews your profile</small></div></li>
            <li><span>3</span><div><b>Start bidding</b><small>Receive invitations that match you</small></div></li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About & Contact -->
  <section id="about" style="max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 32px 120px">
    <div class="zt-about">
      <div class="zt-about-mission">
        <span class="zt-eyebrow">About</span>
        <h2 class="zt-h2">Our mission</h2>
        <p class="zt-lead">Zaytouna is a food manufacturer that presses, bottles and delivers extra virgin olive oil. Everything that goes into our oil, from the olives to the bottle, the label and the press itself, is bought through this platform: fairly for suppliers, clearly for every team, and fully documented from first request to final award.</p>
        <ul class="zt-values">
          <li><b>Transparency</b><span>Criteria and weights are set before bidding opens.</span></li>
          <li><b>Accountability</b><span>Every action is logged with a name and a time.</span></li>
          <li><b>Efficiency</b><span>No paperwork, no lost emails, no scattered files.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div id="contact" class="zt-contact">
        <span class="zt-eyebrow">Contact</span>
        <h2 class="zt-h2" style="font-size: clamp(30px, 3vw, 40px)">Get in touch</h2>
        <form class="zt-form" method="post" action="/Home/Contact">
          @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
          @if (TempData["ContactStatus"] is string zs) { <p class="zt-form-msg" role="status" style="color:#2F6B2A">@zs</p> }
          <div class="zt-form-row">
            <label>Full name<input type="text" name="name" autocomplete="name" required></label>
            <label>Email<input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required></label>
          </div>
          <label>Subject<input type="text" name="subject"></label>
          <label>Message<textarea name="message" rows="4" required></textarea></label>
          <button type="submit" class="zt-submit">Send message</button>
          
        </form>
        <ul class="zt-cdetails">
          <li><span>Email</span>[procurement email]</li>
          <li><span>Phone</span>[phone number]</li>
          <li><span>Address</span>[office address]</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  
    <div class="zt-cats">
      <div class="zt-cats-head"><span class="zt-eyebrow" style="margin:0">What we source</span><p>The categories our tenders cover. Suppliers choose theirs when they register.</p></div>
      <ul><li><span class="zt-cat-ico"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="12" cy="13" rx="6" ry="8"/><path d="M12 5c1-2 3-3 5-3"/></svg></span><span><b>Fresh olives</b><small>From local groves, every harvest season</small></span></li><li><span class="zt-cat-ico"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 2h4v4l2 3v12a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H9a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V9l2-3V2Z"/></svg></span><span><b>Glass bottles &amp; caps</b><small>Bottles, tins, corks and closures</small></span></li><li><span class="zt-cat-ico"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 8 12 3 3 8v8l9 5 9-5V8Z"/><path d="M3 8l9 5 9-5M12 13v8"/></svg></span><span><b>Labels &amp; packaging</b><small>Labels, cartons and shipping boxes</small></span></li><li><span class="zt-cat-ico"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 2v3M12 19v3M2 12h3M19 12h3M4.9 4.9l2.1 2.1M17 17l2.1 2.1M4.9 19.1 7 17M17 7l2.1-2.1"/></svg></span><span><b>Pressing &amp; filling equipment</b><small>Machines, spare parts and maintenance</small></span></li><li><span class="zt-cat-ico"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 3h6M10 3v6l-5 9a2 2 0 0 0 2 3h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-3l-5-9V3"/></svg></span><span><b>Quality &amp; lab testing</b><small>Acidity, purity and food-safety tests</small></span></li><li><span class="zt-cat-ico"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7h11v9H3zM14 10h4l3 3v3h-7"/><circle cx="7" cy="18" r="2"/><circle cx="17" cy="18" r="2"/></svg></span><span><b>Logistics &amp; storage</b><small>Transport, warehousing and cold storage</small></span></li></ul>
    </div>
  </section>

